@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EDF5F6
skinparam classBorderColor #183D50
skinparam ArrowColor #183D50
hide empty members
hide footbox
actor Guest
participant "controller:\nRentalController" as C
participant "service:\nRentalService" as S
participant "storage:\nStorageHandler" as H
participant "renderer:\nRentalRenderer" as R
Guest -> C : cancel(request)
activate C
C -> S : cancel(request)
activate S
note over S
 Find booking and verify guest ownership.
 On an independent candidate copy,
 call Reservation.cancel(today):
 require CONFIRMED and before check-in;
 change status to CANCELLED.
 Domain calls summarized here.
end note
S -> H : save(candidate)
activate H
H --> S : SaveResult(OK)
deactivate H
note over S : Accept saved candidate as current state.
S --> C : Result(OK, cancelledReservation)
deactivate S
C -> R : render(result)
activate R
R --> C : screen updated
deactivate R
C --> Guest : Result(OK, cancelledReservation)
deactivate C
@enduml
